  "2026-10-21T09:53:40.714Z","harness:codex","Root-cause proof: exact current gate invoked through a real file alias exits0 with0 stdout/stderr bytes on --unknown. Extended existing directory-junction subprocess test fails on unchanged code with the same Unexpected end of JSON input as hosted macOS. Fix is being verified in an isolated checkout while the original PR source is held by long-running coverage. Only this new leaf is actively claimed."
  "2026-10-21T09:59:01.354Z","harness:codex","Isolated corrected guard compares physical invocation and module paths. The unchanged directory-alias regression now passes all22 tests, including real and alias paths with ordinary Node loading and --preserve-symlinks-main, valid complete receipts, invalid-argument failure and inert imports. Original source failed21/22 with the same empty-output parse failure as macOS. No advisory thresholds, source requirements, test membership or deadlines changed."
  "2026-10-21T10:16:35.765Z","harness:codex","The alias fix and unchanged subprocess regression are now integrated into PR #1531 alongside the related SDK/CLI read contracts. The linked root test passed all 22 cases. The guard canonicalizes both invocation and module paths, including symlink-preserving Node startup, while imports remain inert. Hosted native macOS acceptance remains pending before closure. GitHub issue #1530 has a specific PM-link comment; its original failed nightly remains preserved."
  "2026-10-21T10:22:42.759Z","harness:codex","The full local static gate correctly rejects two uncovered recurrence members: this defect and its completed collector predecessor. The recorded recurs_from edge exposed a new semantic component absent from the policy. Register a specific physical-entrypoint advisory family with the real subprocess negative control, native macOS checks and complete-lineage validation; retain all enforcement bounds and historical facts."
  "2026-10-21T10:25:18.777Z","harness:codex","Recursive improvement evidence: the new advisory identity family registers the real two-member recurrence component without changing coverage enforcement. Complete-population defect evidence now passes with zero findings and 27 families; all 30 focused advisory/policy cases pass. The CLI assurance risk and lineages primitives select the family from the changed script/item and report no uncovered lineage, so future edits inherit the native and local checks."
  "2026-10-21T10:39:27.771Z","harness:codex","Native acceptance: both macOS Node24 nightly shards succeeded on source 06298bc06e4b9fc2c93cd11e5b16c740c1c215d3 in run39583927222, including the real/alias advisory subprocess regression. The linked advisory and policy commands pass all30 cases. The complete recurrence gate passes after registering the specific actual lineage. The earlier quality job correctly failed the then-unregistered lineage and remains historical evidence. Final reviewed delivery must still pass the unchanged static and coverage checks before merge."
  "2026-10-21T10:44:21.929Z","harness:codex","Settled native run39583927222 confirms both macOS and both Windows Node24 shards succeeded, as did Ubuntu Node22 and25. The quality failure is the already-corrected recurrence registration; the full Ubuntu Node24 coverage job was cancelled and is not counted as passing. Native path acceptance for this fix is complete, while final PR coverage and static admission remain mandatory."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
